The substantive model error is corrected in all three deliverables. The bug was a double application of the self-employed reduction: I used net earnings ($166,230) as the employer base *and* divided by 1.20. The supplied deterministic model uses **Schedule C profit minus half SE tax** as adjusted plan compensation, with **no division by 1.20**.

